  {"type":"fill","q":"\\(3^{455}\\) 的个位数为 ____","answer":["7"],"why":"\\(3^4\\equiv1\\pmod{10}\\)，\\(455=4\\times113+3\\)，\\(3^{455}\\equiv3^3=27\\equiv7\\)。"},
